  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2024 Airbnb.org Annual Grant: Emergency Accommodation Support to Crisis-Affected Populations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Airbnb.org and the International Organization for Migration, IOM - UN Migration, have a partnership to connect people affected by crisis to free, short-term housing. In March 2024, Airbnb.org awarded a grant to IOM for the purpose of providing temporary accommodation to refugees, asylum seekers, evacuees, and persons otherwise displaced by natural hazards or human-made disasters or other mass emergencies. These stays are free and funded by Airbnb, Inc., donors to the Airbnb.org Refugee Fund, and the generosity of hosts through Airbnb.org. All fees are waived for Airbnb.org stays.</narrative>
  </description>
